WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.087
Which is older:

00:00:01.097 --> 00:00:02.637
the board game senet, or the Great

00:00:02.647 --> 00:00:03.475
Pyramid?

00:00:03.485 --> 00:00:04.745
Comment your answer.

00:00:04.755 --> 00:00:07.383
This senet box from Egypt is about

00:00:07.393 --> 00:00:08.674
3,500 years old.

00:00:08.774 --> 00:00:11.925
But senet itself goes back about 5,000

00:00:11.935 --> 00:00:12.435
years.

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:13.964
The Great Pyramid?

00:00:13.974 --> 00:00:15.042
About 4,500.

00:00:15.191 --> 00:00:16.269
Senet wins.

00:00:16.279 --> 00:00:18.752
Its name means passing, and later it

00:00:18.762 --> 00:00:20.302
stood for the soul's journey to the

00:00:20.312 --> 00:00:21.362
afterlife.
